are 'top_k_2 zero-shot' (3199 rows) and 'top_k_2 RAG' (3199 rows) the exact same dataset? True
they match: same number of rows (3199), same set of file paths, and the file paths are in the same order.
zero-shot accuracy: 78.15%
rag accuracy: 85.0%
